{%- render 'glp1-assets' -%}
<div class="g1 g1-soft">
  <section class="g1-sec">
    <div class="g1-wrap">
      <div class="g1-center">
        <div class="g1-eyebrow">Inside every capsule</div>
        <h2 class="g1-h2">1 molecule. 1 job: keep the follicle growing.</h2>
        <p class="g1-lede">Spermidine. <span class="g1-gap">[GAP: mg per serving]</span> <span class="g1-gap">[GAP: source, wheat germ or synthetic]</span>. It's a polyamine, not a vitamin. Every cell in the body makes it. Levels fall with age. It shows up in wheat germ, natto, aged cheese, and mushrooms.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="g1-split" style="margin-top:44px;align-items:stretch">
        {%- if section.settings.image != blank -%}
          <div style="min-height:380px">{{ section.settings.image | image_url: width: 1200 | image_tag: class: 'g1-img', loading: 'lazy' }}</div>
        {%- else -%}
          <div class="g1-ph" style="min-height:380px"><span>Image: the bottle with wheat germ, aged cheese, and mushrooms around it</span></div>
        {%- endif -%}
        <div class="g1-ing-grid">
          <div class="g1-card g1-ing"><h3>Keeps the hair root dividing</h3><p>The cells at the base of a growing hair are some of the fastest-dividing cells in the body. They depend on polyamines to keep going. Spermidine keeps them dividing and pushes back the day the follicle quits growing.</p></div>
          <div class="g1-card g1-ing"><h3>Switches on eIF5A</h3><p>eIF5A is a protein that fast-dividing cells use to keep building. It only turns on with spermidine. No other molecule can do it.</p></div>
          <div class="g1-card g1-ing"><h3>The molecule of lean times</h3><p>When the body fasts, it raises its own spermidine. Researchers found fasting's cell-cleanup benefit doesn't happen without it.</p></div>
          <div class="g1-card g1-ing"><h3>Works on the measure that matters</h3><p>In human scalp follicles grown in the lab, spermidine kept more of them in the growth phase. Then the placebo trial confirmed it in people: 52% more growth-phase hairs at 90 days.</p></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="g1-center" style="margin-top:32px;font-size:15.5px"><b>What's not inside:</b> no biotin megadose, no saw palmetto, no pumpkin seed, and no hormones. <span class="g1-gap">[GAP: full ingredient list]</span> &nbsp; <b>How to take it:</b> <span class="g1-gap">[GAP: capsules per day, timing]</span></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "GLP-1 What's inside",
  "settings": [
    { "type": "image_picker", "id": "image", "label": "Image", "info": "Bottle with wheat germ, aged cheese, and mushrooms around it" }
  ],
  "presets": [{ "name": "GLP-1 What's inside" }]
}
{% endschema %}
